title: genua: Extend
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/genua
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows custom check data created by customer specific scripts on
 genua appliances. The format is described in GENUA-EXTEND-MIB.

 The check supports the OID table under ".1.3.6.1.4.1.3717.66.1.1"

discovery:
 A service is created if
 - the device is recognized as a genua device
 - the OID table under ".1.3.6.1.4.1.3717.66.1.1.*" exists
